 "what_this_decision_is": {
  "cell_dimension": "OFF_BOARD_BOM.md told a buyer 60 x 75 x 8.0 mm.  D-239/D-243 narrowed the reserved envelope to 57 mm and the board's BATTERY_SHADOW is 57 mm wide.  Corrected.  Both named candidate cells are 50 mm wide, so the document was wrong and nothing that was going to be ordered is affected.",
  "determinism": "connection_width_contract emitted a non-deterministic field -- the two endpoints of a pair in DRC-report order, which flipped between d759 and d760 on a byte-identical board.  Canonicalised.",
  "height_result": {
   "BATTERY_SHADOW": {
