  "j7": "recorded in the register's section 4 with its measured intrusion: 0.870 mm inside the \u00d848 CLEAR region and 0.130 mm OUTSIDE the \u00d846 coil.",
  "mitigation": "OFF_BOARD_BOM.md now REQUIRES a 0.5 mm compliant insulating sheet over the rear face under the pack.  It spreads three 1206 hard points and insulates the cell from rear copper; it does NOT close the 0.60 mm gap and is not offered as if it did.",
  "mk8": "the three height rules FBV2_P1_KEEPOUTS.md section 3 carries had never been compared with a part.  MK8 measures every fitted part in each region against its package's published maximum height, from a table where every row records WHERE the figure came from.",
  "why_the_part_and_not_the_family": "TI's own DDC0006A outline says 'SOT-23 - 1.1 max height'.  The SOT-23 FAMILY maximum is 1.45 mm, which would have reported U20 over a limit it meets by 0.100 mm."
 }
